{"anchor":{"char_end":15662,"char_start":15547,"method":"context_located"},"asset_id":"fml-src-debondt-thaler-1985-overreact-d07fdf64-0014","content_sha256":"6d7049449c54f3f019993e9e6a3a55eb401265ef615bfd543374ce8d6016d85d","extractor":"visual_read_v1","fidelity":"transcribed","kind":"formula","page":6,"payload":{"image":"assets/page-0006.png","latex":"\\hat{u}_{jt} = R_{jt} - R_{mt}","surrounding_text":"Therefore, we will only report the results based on market-adjusted excess returns. The residuals are estimated as","transcribed":true},"source_id":"src-debondt-thaler-1985-overreact-d07fdf64","text":"\\hat{u}_{jt} = R_{jt} - R_{mt}","verification":{"found_in_text_layer":0,"not_found":[],"numeric_tokens":0,"ratio":null}}
{"anchor":{"char_end":17694,"char_start":17556,"method":"context_located"},"asset_id":"fml-src-debondt-thaler-1985-overreact-d07fdf64-0015","content_sha256":"56e6377c3836b35f0693ffb6528d199f8400c73de20803d30a5e281221487081","extractor":"visual_read_v1","fidelity":"transcribed","kind":"formula","page":6,"payload":{"image":"assets/page-0006.png","latex":"CU_j = \\sum_{t=-35}^{t=0} u_{jt}","surrounding_text":"For every stock j, starting in December 1932 (month 84; the \"portfolio formation date\") (t = 0), we compute the cumulative excess returns","transcribed":true},"source_id":"src-debondt-thaler-1985-overreact-d07fdf64","text":"CU_j = \\sum_{t=-35}^{t=0} u_{jt}","verification":{"found_in_text_layer":2,"not_found":[],"numeric_tokens":2,"ratio":1.0}}
{"anchor":{"char_end":21461,"char_start":18541,"method":"page_region"},"asset_id":"fml-src-debondt-thaler-1985-overreact-d07fdf64-0016","content_sha256":"1e69f9d73269d3512243863a0b8416ab7f2cfa9e2076d02e702fee9af16d2ad3","extractor":"visual_read_v1","fidelity":"transcribed","kind":"formula","page":7,"payload":{"image":"assets/page-0007.png","latex":"ACAR_{W,t} = \\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{n=1}^{N} CAR_{W,n,t} \\quad\\text{and}\\quad ACAR_{L,t} = \\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{n=1}^{N} CAR_{L,n,t}","surrounding_text":"Average cumulative average residuals are computed for both portfolios, for each month between t = 1 and t = 36.","transcribed":true},"source_id":"src-debondt-thaler-1985-overreact-d07fdf64","text":"ACAR_{W,t} = \\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{n=1}^{N} CAR_{W,n,t} \\quad\\text{and}\\quad ACAR_{L,t} = \\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{n=1}^{N} CAR_{L,n,t}","verification":{"found_in_text_layer":4,"not_found":[],"numeric_tokens":4,"ratio":1.0}}
{"anchor":{"char_end":21461,"char_start":18541,"method":"page_region"},"asset_id":"fml-src-debondt-thaler-1985-overreact-d07fdf64-0017","content_sha256":"34d2b555c1609b93fec4ebbb3c098b44d4d08e2240ee6d1ad9bbfa0be1dca663","extractor":"visual_read_v1","fidelity":"transcribed","kind":"formula","page":7,"payload":{"image":"assets/page-0007.png","latex":"S_t^2 = \\left[\\sum_{n=1}^{N}(CAR_{W,n,t} - ACAR_{W,t})^2 + \\sum_{n=1}^{N}(CAR_{L,n,t} - ACAR_{L,t})^2\\right] / 2(N-1)","surrounding_text":"The pooled estimate of the population variance in CAR_t is","transcribed":true},"source_id":"src-debondt-thaler-1985-overreact-d07fdf64","text":"S_t^2 = \\left[\\sum_{n=1}^{N}(CAR_{W,n,t} - ACAR_{W,t})^2 + \\sum_{n=1}^{N}(CAR_{L,n,t} - ACAR_{L,t})^2\\right] / 2(N-1)","verification":{"found_in_text_layer":7,"not_found":[],"numeric_tokens":7,"ratio":1.0}}
{"anchor":{"char_end":21461,"char_start":18541,"method":"page_region"},"asset_id":"fml-src-debondt-thaler-1985-overreact-d07fdf64-0018","content_sha256":"0b3e8a815cb3105f364b1e14c78ed4160be36084de08f23cc84d84b8e41a83db","extractor":"visual_read_v1","fidelity":"transcribed","kind":"formula","page":7,"payload":{"image":"assets/page-0007.png","latex":"T_t = \\left[ACAR_{L,t} - ACAR_{W,t}\\right] / \\sqrt{2 S_t^2 / N}","surrounding_text":"Thus, the t-statistic for the difference between the loser and winner portfolios is","transcribed":true},"source_id":"src-debondt-thaler-1985-overreact-d07fdf64","text":"T_t = \\left[ACAR_{L,t} - ACAR_{W,t}\\right] / \\sqrt{2 S_t^2 / N}","verification":{"found_in_text_layer":2,"not_found":[],"numeric_tokens":2,"ratio":1.0}}
{"anchor":{"char_end":21461,"char_start":18541,"method":"page_region"},"asset_id":"fml-src-debondt-thaler-1985-overreact-d07fdf64-0019","content_sha256":"d2155362ece9052b8ac0d704520518f154a6738eac8e1530683410f5cb757284","extractor":"visual_read_v1","fidelity":"transcribed","kind":"formula","page":7,"payload":{"image":"assets/page-0007.png","latex":"s_t = \\sqrt{\\sum_{n=1}^{N}(AR_{W,n,t} - AR_{W,t})^2 / (N-1)}","surrounding_text":"the sample standard deviation of the average residuals for the winner portfolio","transcribed":true},"source_id":"src-debondt-thaler-1985-overreact-d07fdf64","text":"s_t = \\sqrt{\\sum_{n=1}^{N}(AR_{W,n,t} - AR_{W,t})^2 / (N-1)}","verification":{"found_in_text_layer":3,"not_found":[],"numeric_tokens":3,"ratio":1.0}}
{"anchor":{"char_end":21461,"char_start":18541,"method":"page_region"},"asset_id":"fml-src-debondt-thaler-1985-overreact-d07fdf64-0020","content_sha256":"0e96f2faf4215ec5aee741987cfc8035385ae111d8f8de6d11ce74bd8841a67f","extractor":"visual_read_v1","fidelity":"transcribed","kind":"formula","page":7,"payload":{"image":"assets/page-0007.png","latex":"T_t = AR_{W,t} / (s_t / \\sqrt{N})","surrounding_text":"the t-statistic for the winner portfolio's average residual in month t","transcribed":true},"source_id":"src-debondt-thaler-1985-overreact-d07fdf64","text":"T_t = AR_{W,t} / (s_t / \\sqrt{N})","verification":{"found_in_text_layer":0,"not_found":[],"numeric_tokens":0,"ratio":null}}
